Licence for the data files in this directory
============================================

The files in this directory are derived from the ChEMBL database (target
CHEMBL203, human EGFR; ChEMBL_37, released 2026-05-01). They are adaptations
of ChEMBL content produced by the scripts in ../scripts/.

ChEMBL is released under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
Unported licence (CC BY-SA 3.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Because CC BY-SA 3.0 is a ShareAlike licence, these derived files are
redistributed under the same licence. If you reuse or adapt them, you must
give attribution and release your adaptation under CC BY-SA 3.0 as well.

This differs from the MIT licence that covers the source code in this
repository (see ../LICENSE).

